cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "eFFeQuadro — Forensic Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  A forensic analysis tool for HFS volumes and Microsoft Word for Macintosh
  documents from the classic Mac era (1980s–1990s). It analyses the Catalog
  B-tree, the Extents Overflow file, the allocation bitmap and the Master
  Directory Block; recovers Word fragments from unallocated space; extracts
  hidden text from .mcw files and compares successive drafts. Developed to
  support research in forensic philology on born-digital literary archives.
